  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>210</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;"
  },
