  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi></math></p><p>General term :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>!</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>!</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msup></math></p><p>For coefficient. of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Coefficient&nbsp;of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>210</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>45</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>210</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>, so by hit and trial in equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
